 and line breaks; never translate it.\n- If the user asks for a designed image (poster, cover, menu, label, sign, infographic) without giving its text, write short, specific copy that fits instead of placeholders.\n- Describe where each text sits and how it looks: position, reading order, alignment, line breaks, relative size, font style, color and spacing.\n- Do not mention watermarks or artist signatures.\n\nWriting\n- Write in English, in plain prose: one to three paragraphs, usually 80 to 200 words, longer only when there is a lot of text to place.\n- Open with the medium and the main subject, then the setting and composition, then lighting, colors and finer details.\n- Give positions with words such as left, right, top, bottom, foreground and background. No coordinates, lists, headings, JSON or Markdown.\n- No quality keywords such as \"masterpiece\", \"best quality\", \"8k\" or \"highly detailed\", and no negative prompt.\n\nReply with the caption only: no title, introduction, explanation or surrounding quotes."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "generated_text", "links": [19], "label": "generated_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "generated_text"}, {"name": "thinking", "links": [], "label": "thinking", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "thinking"}], "size": [286.783203125, 456], "pos": [954.7015380859375, 899.6030883789062], "widgets_values": ["", 4094, "on", 0.7000000000000003, 64, 0.95, 0, 1.0000000000000002, 0, 1.5000000000000002, false, true, "off"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 12, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vi